  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance in creating a bioenergy industry and value chain for clean cooking in Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to introduce waste to energy technologies and business models in agro-industries to address deforestation, household air pollution, and  access to clean fuels for cooking in Mali. The project intends to support ANDEB to implement its strategies for promoting modern bioenergy  and affordable cooking solutions such as pellets, biogas and bioethanol. Viable bioenergy technologies and models will be demonstrated in cotton, sugar industry and slaughterhouses.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regular Programme Of Technical Cooperati</narrative>
  </participating-org>
